    5. Build each loser tile by coloring the loser mask with its assigned color.
    6. Build the winner tile by coloring the winner mask with its assigned color.
    7. Pick a random position for the winner among the tiles.
    8. Concatenate tiles into the strip (horizontal or vertical).
    9. Output is the winner tile.
```
